{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-05258-00002","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["이란 정부는 감염을 막기 위해 주요 발병 지역에서 금요 대예배까지 취소했다.","이란은 전체 인구 8399만명 중에 이슬람교도가 98%다."],"reason":"The summary says Italy is 98% Muslim and that Italy canceled Friday prayers. The source says Iran did both. It also says the pope canceled his schedule to prevent infection, which the source doesn't say. It leaves out Italy's 653 cases and 17 deaths. The wording is repetitive."},"B":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["유럽 전체 사망자가 19명인데 이탈리아가 17명이고 나머지 2명은 프랑스다.","이란과 국경을 맞댄 파키스탄"],"reason":"The summary says \"프랑스 2명은 이탈리아다\", which garbles the source: Italy has 17 deaths and France has 2. It also says Georgia borders Iran, but only Pakistan is described that way. It leaves out the deaths exceeding Korea's and the Netherlands case details."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":3,"evidence":["이란과 국경을 맞댄 파키스탄에서 첫 확진자가 나왔고","인구 6046만명의 이탈리아에서는 가톨릭 신자가 약 85%다."],"reason":"Most of the key facts are preserved: Italy's 653 cases, 17 deaths, the Netherlands case and the Lombardy link. It wrongly says Georgia borders Iran. It repeats the New Zealand sentence and leaves out that the New Zealand patient had visited Iran. The Netherlands sentence is clumsy."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["뉴질랜드 언론은 28일 최근 이란을 방문한 사람이 감염된 것으로 확인됐으며","잠정 파악된 사망자 수도 17명으로 한국의 사망자 수(13명)를 넘어섰다."],"reason":"The summary is accurate and faithful to the source. It leaves out the Iran Friday-prayer cancellation, the pope and the Lombardy link, and it doesn't say these were first cases. It also doesn't say the 17 deaths were in Italy, though the sentence implies it."}}}
